lows even when aggregate on-chain totals reprice slowly. Related: <a href=\"https://cointelegraph.com/news/wisdomtree-moonpay-team-up-to-expand-us-access-to-tokenized-money-market-fund?utm_source=rss_feed&amp;utm_medium=rss&amp;utm_campaign=rss_partner_inbound\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">WisdomTree, MoonPay team up to expand US access to tokenized money market fund</a> (CoinTelegraph).</li></ul><p class=\"takeaways__note\">Context only\u2014not investment advice. Bullets combine on-page data with recent industry headlines.</p></div><p class=\"review-note ko-disclaimer\">Key observations are AI generated and should be reviewed for accuracy.</p>",
